 From MIndex-class.R:

setMethod("names", "MIndex", function(x) x at NAMES)

setReplaceMethod("names", "MIndex",
     function(x, value)
         stop("attempt to modify the names of a ", class(x), "  
instance")
)


For now, a pretty safe workaround for you is

	txmatches1 at NAMES <- names(probeset)

	
